constructed
Built to exercise the gateway-provider branch of `parsed_from_result_line`:
a fast `result` line naming a gateway-style model id
("anthropic/claude-opus-4.6"), used to prove that a gateway-routed run is
never upgraded to `harness_reported` just because a terminal result line
arrived quickly — the init line it came from fires before any network call
reaches the gateway. The claude_code_version differs from the other
fixtures only because it was captured during a later exploration pass; the
shape itself is representative of stream-json's format at either version.
